UQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17508, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01S8LQMwTfCxX4DQHNUedP3L", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.2.9 and v2.3.0 were both healthy in production; v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy). (2) The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving the service mixed: us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. (3) Retried the rollback to v2.3.0; all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) now run v2.3.0. Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure cause, investigate the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt, and decide when v2.3.1 can be redeployed."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48108, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01S8LQMwTfCxX4DQHNUedP3L", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48108, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01S8LQMwTfCxX4DQHNUedP3L", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49587, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016cCr4jN5z2zFXSm6chWBZi", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49887, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016cCr4jN5z2zFXSm6chWBZi", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1,